        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Its growls make its opponents uneasy. This laid-back Pokémon tends to sleep half the day.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "唸り声は　相手を　不安に させる。　普段は　のんびり屋で １日の　半分は　寝ているよ。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il s’attache très facilement et aime être cajolé. Une telle sensibilité cachée derrière une mine renfrognée fait fondre beaucoup de jeunes gens.",
